244 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (SQL stands for Structured Query Language. It's a programming language designed for managing and manipulating relational databases. SQL is used to perform various operations on databases such as storing, retrieving, updating, and deleting data. It provides a standardized way to interact with databases, making it easier to manage and analyze large volumes of data efficiently.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
