246 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (We need a database to efficiently store, organize, and retrieve large amounts of structured data, enabling easier access, manipulation, and analysis of information for various purposes such as managing business operations, storing user data, and facilitating data-driven decision making.)
/Pg 7 0 R
/K [7]
>>
