544 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (A view is a saved SQL query stored in a database, representing a subset of data from one or more tables. It appears like a table to users, allowing them to query it without knowing the underlying complexity of the database structure.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
545 0 obj
<<
