567 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/ActualText (Data Definition Language \(DDL\) is used to define the structure of a database, such as creating, altering, and dropping tables, indexes, and views. Data Manipulation Language \(DML\) is used to manipulate the data within the database, such as inserting, updating, deleting, and querying data.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [10]
>>
